@startuml
title Sequence - UC-16 Xác thực người dùng (OAuth2/OIDC - Authorization Code with PKCE)
actor "User" as User
participant "Client App/Web" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "IdP (Google/Azure)" as IdP

User -> Client : Click "Sign in with SSO"
Client -> Client : Generate code_verifier, code_challenge(S256), state, nonce
Client -> IdP : Authorization Request\n(response_type=code, code_challenge, code_challenge_method=S256,\n state, nonce, redirect_uri)
IdP --> User : Login form
User -> IdP : Enter credentials / consent
IdP --> Client : Redirect back with code, state (to redirect_uri)
Client -> IdP : Token Exchange\n(grant_type=authorization_code, code, code_verifier, redirect_uri)
IdP --> Client : id_token, access_token, refresh_token
Client -> API : API request with Authorization: Bearer access_token
API -> Auth : Validate token (JWKS/Introspection)
Auth --> API : user info / validation result
API --> Client : set session/return response
Client --> User : Logged in
@enduml